          "@value": "Self Insurance Reserve, Current",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "rdfs:comment": [
        {
          "@value": "Carrying amount of accrued known and estimated losses incurred as of the balance sheet date for which no insurance coverage exists, and for which a claim has been made or is probable of being asserted, typically arising from workmen's compensation-type of incidents and personal injury to nonemployees from accidents on the entity's property that are expected to be paid within one year (or the normal operating cycle, if longer).",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ]
    },
